@startuml
title check の歩み 2/3 — arrow が新しいサブ問題を作る
left to right direction

actor "user:alice" as alice
actor "user:bob" as bob
rectangle "group:eng" as eng
rectangle "folder:root" as root
rectangle "folder:eng-docs" as engdocs #FFF2B2
rectangle "document:design" as design

design -[#DAA520,bold]-> engdocs : parent
engdocs --> root : parent
root --> alice : owner
engdocs --> eng : viewer\n(#member)
eng --> bob : member

note bottom of design
  直接の viewer に bob はいない。
  parent->view が「folder:eng-docs を
  view できるか?」という新しいサブ問題になる
end note
@enduml
